    prompt "LLM Dot samples per module"
    default LLM_P32_DOT_SAMPLES_256
    help
        Select a deterministic, evenly spaced number of four-element
        input-times-weight Dot vectors from each exported linear module.
        A module with fewer vectors is replayed in full without duplicates.

