    prompt "LLM P32-to-Int trace tensor"
    default LLM_P32_TO_INT_TENSOR_INPUT
    help
        Select the real LLM tensor distribution converted from Posit32 to
        Int32. Input and output are activations; weight is the projection
        parameter distribution.

